m0099"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"恂子，善笙、西陽太守。《宋書》52作稚，梁50傳徵祖稚也任宋司徒主簿。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"684_eaa_511_A","source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi019-ruzi-xun-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p006","quote":"恂子孺子，少與族兄莊齊名。多藝能，尤善聲律。車騎將軍王彧，孺子姑之子也。嘗與孺子宴桐臺，孺子吹笙，彧自起舞，旣而歎曰：「今日眞使人飄颻有伊、洛間意。」爲新安王主簿，出爲廬江郡，辭，宋孝武謂有司曰：「謝孺子不可屈爲小郡。」乃以爲司徒主簿。後以家貧，求西陽太守，卒官。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p006:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p006:m0000","source_term":"恂子孺子"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"本句並書父與子。《宋書》同人作「恂子稚」。"}},{"id":"684_eaa_511_AAA","label":"謝璟","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"璟","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p007:m0001","c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p007:m0026"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p007","quote":"璟","mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p007:m0001"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p007","quote":"璟","mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p007:m0026"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"孺子子，微父；《梁書》50徵傳具名父璟，其從叔朓與開西邸、入侍、辭年老求金紫等兩書同事。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"684_eaa_511_AA","source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi019-jing-ruzi-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p006","quote":"恂子孺子，少與族兄莊齊名。多藝能，尤善聲律。車騎將軍王彧，孺子姑之子也。嘗與孺子宴桐臺，孺子吹笙，彧自起舞，旣而歎曰：「今日眞使人飄颻有伊、洛間意。」爲新安王主簿，出爲廬江郡，辭，宋孝武謂有司曰：「謝孺子不可屈爲小郡。」乃以爲司徒主簿。後以家貧，求西陽太守，卒官。","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p006:m0002","source_term":"子"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p007","quote":"子璟，少與從叔朓俱知名。齊竟陵王子良開西邸，招文學，璟亦預焉。位中書郎。梁天監中，爲左戶尙書，再遷侍中，固辭年老求金紫，帝不悅，未敘，會卒。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p007:m0001","source_term":"子"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"按相鄰正文的傳主與子某讀父子，數位節題有獨立字位。"}},{"id":"684_eaa_511_AAAA","label":"謝微","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"微","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0001","c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0069","c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0149","c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0155"]},{"surface":"玄度","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0003"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008","quote":"微","mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0001"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008","quote":"玄度","mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0003"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008","quote":"微","mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0069"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008","quote":"微","mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0149"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008","quote":"微","mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0155"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"《南史》19作微，字玄度。《梁書》50作謝徵，父璟、祖稚，字同，二刻成詩、任尚書左丞、卒官及著集二十卷均相合。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"684_eaa_511_AAA","source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi019-wei-jing-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p007","quote":"子璟，少與從叔朓俱知名。齊竟陵王子良開西邸，招文學，璟亦預焉。位中書郎。梁天監中，爲左戶尙書，再遷侍中，固辭年老求金紫，帝不悅，未敘，會卒。","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p007:m0001","source_term":"子"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008","quote":"子微字玄度，美風采，好學善屬文，位兼中書舍人。與河東裴子野、沛國劉顯同官友善。時魏中山王元略還北，梁武帝餞於武德殿，賦詩三十韻，限三刻成。微二刻便就，文甚美，帝再覽焉。又爲臨汝侯猷制放生文，亦見賞於世。後除尙書左丞。及昭明太子薨，帝立晉安王綱爲皇太子，將出詔，唯召尙書右僕射何敬容、宣惠將軍孔休源及微三人與議。微時年位尙輕，而任遇已重。後卒於北中郎豫章王長史、南蘭陵太守。文集二十卷。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0001","source_term":"子"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"按相鄰正文的傳主與子某讀父子，數位節題有獨立字位。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","raw_mention_cou