ants","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762"},{"id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008","text":"子微字玄度，美風采，好學善屬文，位兼中書舍人。與河東裴子野、沛國劉顯同官友善。時魏中山王元略還北，梁武帝餞於武德殿，賦詩三十韻，限三刻成。微二刻便就，文甚美，帝再覽焉。又爲臨汝侯猷制放生文，亦見賞於世。後除尙書左丞。及昭明太子薨，帝立晉安王綱爲皇太子，將出詔，唯召尙書右僕射何敬容、宣惠將軍孔休源及微三人與議。微時年位尙輕，而任遇已重。後卒於北中郎豫章王長史、南蘭陵太守。文集二十卷。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":1,"end":2,"surface":"微","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0001","person_id":"684_eaa_511_AAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝微。"},{"start":3,"end":5,"surface":"玄度","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0003","person_id":"684_eaa_511_AAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝微。"},{"start":26,"end":29,"surface":"裴子野","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0026","person_id":"vpy_180_2oi_AAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作裴子野。"},{"start":32,"end":34,"surface":"劉顯","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0032","person_id":"mcd_vna_05k","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作劉顯。"},{"start":44,"end":46,"surface":"元略","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0044","person_id":"ajj_c35_na9","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作元略。"},{"start":69,"end":70,"surface":"微","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0069","person_id":"684_eaa_511_AAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝微。"},{"start":89,"end":90,"surface":"猷","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0089","person_id":"asf_oz2_jik","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作蕭淵猷。"},{"start":120,"end":121,"surface":"綱","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p008:m0120","person_id":"rtd_v0b_nyn","kind":"person","status":"co